## Architecture

### Core Pipeline (order is safety-inviolable — never reorder)

```
Camera → FrameQualityGuard → YOLO / MiDaS / MotionPreAlert → Tracker (Kalman+Hungarian) → FusionEngine → AlertFilter → AlertManager → TTS / Haptic / Earcon
```

